WEBVTT

00:11:59.055 --> 00:12:01.668
about the fact that
I had wanted to be a writer.

00:12:01.692 --> 00:12:03.198
It didn't even enter my head.

00:12:03.222 --> 00:12:08.995
But the minute I was out,
within 24 hours, I started writing.

00:12:09.019 --> 00:12:13.767
And a week later, I signed up for a class
in creative nonfiction writing at NYU.

00:12:13.791 --> 00:12:15.968
And I showed up at this class,

00:12:15.992 --> 00:12:20.542
and I still remember this moment
of sitting in this class and feeling like,

00:12:20.566 --> 00:12:23.567
"Ah! This is what I was supposed
to be doing the whole time!"

00:12:23.591 --> 00:12:29.794
And, you know, I had no idea at all
that I would ever make a living at it.

00:12:29.818 --> 00:12:32.004
I never assumed that I could,
but I thought,